Both functions remain. Both verify blocks remain.

========================================================================
RESIDUAL (named, not closed)
========================================================================

1. CHS still implements the RFC digest. Implementation ≠ security.
2. Verify is length-only (F41 class). Wrong 32/40-char hex would pass.
3. `core/crypto.oo` still says "real SHA-256/HMAC" — other OWN (F38/F40).
4. Docs remove F39 from SPRINT HIGH when they accept this ledger.

**Round:** F39 comment restatement. Collision residual remains honest.
